#. ja: ロストアラガン強化薬
#. de: Phiole[p] verschollenen allagischen Roborans
#. fr: fiole d'agent renforçant allagois oublié
#. column 2: flasks of lost Allagan roborant
#. column 8: An alchemical potion concocted by mad scientists a thousand years dead. Some of the realm's more daring blacksmiths have applied the unnaturally viscous substance to a variety of weapons and found that it heightens the attributes of certain martial artifacts of ancient Allagan design. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete.
#. column 9: Lost Allagan Roborant
msgctxt "Item:19104:0:0"
msgid "flask of lost Allagan roborant"
msgstr "флакон утраченного аллагского укрепителя"

#. de: Phiolen[p] verschollenen allagischen Roborans
#. fr: fioles d'agent renforçant allagois oublié
#. column 0: flask of lost Allagan roborant
#. column 8: An alchemical potion concocted by mad scientists a thousand years dead. Some of the realm's more daring blacksmiths have applied the unnaturally viscous substance to a variety of weapons and found that it heightens the attributes of certain martial artifacts of ancient Allagan design. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete.
#. column 9: Lost Allagan Roborant
msgctxt "Item:19104:0:2"
msgid "flasks of lost Allagan roborant"
msgstr "флаконы с утраченным аллагским снадобьем"

#. ja: 失われていたアラグの技術を再現した錬金薬。<br>ロストアラガン武器の改良に最適な性質を秘める。<br>かつて【武器】の強化に用いられていたが、今や技術の進歩により必要とされていない
#. de: Eine alchemistische Substanz aus den Laboren vor langer Zeit verstorbener Forscher. Sie verstärkt die Eigenschaften bestimmter verschollener allagischer Waffen.<br>(Wurde zur Verstärkung von Waffen benutzt, ist nun aber nicht mehr erforderlich.)
#. fr: Cette mixture alchimique, fabriquée grâce à des procédés oubliés, permettait d'améliorer les armes allagoises oubliées. De meilleures techniques ont été inventées depuis sa découverte, et plus personne ne l'utilise aujourd'hui.
#. column 0: flask of lost Allagan roborant
#. column 2: flasks of lost Allagan roborant
#. column 9: Lost Allagan Roborant
msgctxt "Item:19104:0:8"
msgid "An alchemical potion concocted by mad scientists a thousand years dead. Some of the realm's more daring blacksmiths have applied the unnaturally viscous substance to a variety of weapons and found that it heightens the attributes of certain martial artifacts of ancient Allagan design. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete."
msgstr "Алхимическое зелье, созданное безумными учёными, умершими тысячу лет назад. Самые отчаянные кузнецы царства наносили эту неестественно вязкую субстанцию на оружие и обнаружили, что она усиливает свойства некоторых древних аллагских боевых артефактов. Но ремесленные технологии шагнули вперёд, и теперь снадобье устарело."

#. ja: ロストアラガン強化薬
#. de: Verschollenes allagisches Roborans
#. fr: Agent renforçant allagois oublié
#. column 0: flask of lost Allagan roborant
#. column 2: flasks of lost Allagan roborant
#. column 8: An alchemical potion concocted by mad scientists a thousand years dead. Some of the realm's more daring blacksmiths have applied the unnaturally viscous substance to a variety of weapons and found that it heightens the attributes of certain martial artifacts of ancient Allagan design. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete.
msgctxt "Item:19104:0:9"
msgid "Lost Allagan Roborant"
msgstr "Утраченное аллагское снадобье"

#. ja: ロストアラガン強化繊維
#. de: verschollen[a] allagisch[a] Faser
#. fr: rouleau de fibre quintessenciée allagoise oubliée
#. column 2: spools of lost Allagan twine
#. column 8: An alchemical thread woven by mad scientists a thousand years dead. Some of the realm's more daring weavers have applied the unnaturally pliable substance to a variety of vestments and found that it heightens the attributes of certain martial artifacts of ancient Allagan design. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete.
#. column 9: Lost Allagan Twine
msgctxt "Item:19105:0:0"
msgid "spool of lost Allagan twine"
msgstr "моток утраченной аллагской нити"

#. de: verschollen[a] allagisch[a] Fasern
#. fr: rouleaux de fibre quintessenciée allagoise oubliée
#. column 0: spool of lost Allagan twine
#. column 8: An alchemical thread woven by mad scientists a thousand years dead. Some of the realm's more daring weavers have applied the unnaturally pliable substance to a variety of vestments and found that it heightens the attributes of certain martial artifacts of ancient Allagan design. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete.
#. column 9: Lost Allagan Twine
msgctxt "Item:19105:0:2"
msgid "spools of lost Allagan twine"
msgstr "мотки утраченной аллагской нити"

#. ja: 失われていたアラグの技術を再現した強化繊維。<br>ロストアラガン防具の改良に最適な性質を秘める。<br>かつて【防具】の強化に用いられていたが、今や技術の進歩により必要とされていない
#. de: Eine alchemistische Substanz aus den Laboren vor langer Zeit verstorbener Forscher. Sie verstärkt die Eigenschaften bestimmter verschollener allagischer Rüstungsteile.<br>(Wurde zur Verstärkung von Ausrüstung benutzt, ist nun aber nicht mehr erforderlich.)
#. fr: Cette fibre, fabriquée grâce à des procédés oubliés, permettait d'améliorer les armures allagoises oubliées. De meilleures techniques ont été inventées depuis sa découverte, et plus personne ne l'utilise aujourd'hui.
#. column 0: spool of lost Allagan twine
#. column 2: spools of lost Allagan twine
#. column 9: Lost Allagan Twine
msgctxt "Item:19105:0:8"
msgid "An alchemical thread woven by mad scientists a thousand years dead. Some of the realm's more daring weavers have applied the unnaturally pliable substance to a variety of vestments and found that it heightens the attributes of certain martial artifacts of ancient Allagan design. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete."
msgstr "Алхимическая нить, созданная безумными учёными, умершими тысячу лет назад. Самые отчаянные ткачи царства использовали эту неестественно гибкую субстанцию для изготовления одеяний и обнаружили, что она усиливает свойства некоторых древних аллагских боевых артефактов. Но ремесленные технологии шагнули вперёд, и теперь нить устарела."

