#. fr: Fibre quintessenciée allagoise oubliée
#. column 0: spool of lost Allagan twine
#. column 2: spools of lost Allagan twine
#. column 8: An alchemical thread woven by mad scientists a thousand years dead. Some of the realm's more daring weavers have applied the unnaturally pliable substance to a variety of vestments and found that it heightens the attributes of certain martial artifacts of ancient Allagan design. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete.
msgctxt "Item:19105:0:9"
msgid "Lost Allagan Twine"
msgstr "Утраченная аллагская нить"

