msgstr "Утраченная аллагская глазурь"

#. ja: ロウェナの手形:万物
#. de: Rowena-Marke[p] „Schöpfung“
#. fr: avoir de Rowena (cosmogonique/poétique)
#. column 2: Rowena's tokens (creation)
#. column 8: A note of promise received from Rowena for the delivery of Allagan tomestones of creation or poetics. However, due to the House of Splendors changing its policies, it is now worth less than the paper on which it is scribed.
#. column 9: Rowena's Token (Creation)
msgctxt "Item:19107:0:0"
msgid "Rowena's token (creation)"
msgstr "вексель Ровены (мироздание)"

#. de: Rowena-Marken[p] „Schöpfung“
#. fr: avoirs de Rowena (cosmogoniques/poétiques)
#. column 0: Rowena's token (creation)
#. column 8: A note of promise received from Rowena for the delivery of Allagan tomestones of creation or poetics. However, due to the House of Splendors changing its policies, it is now worth less than the paper on which it is scribed.
#. column 9: Rowena's Token (Creation)
msgctxt "Item:19107:0:2"
msgid "Rowena's tokens (creation)"
msgstr "вексели Ровены (мироздание)"

#. ja: アラガントームストーン:万物もしくは詩学を納品した証となる商人ロウェナの手形だった紙切れ。<br>引き換え期限が終了し、今や取引には利用できない
#. de: Von Rowena für die Abgabe Allagischer Steine der Schöpfung oder Poesie ausgegebene Bestätigungsmarke. Der Handel mit diesen Marken wurde beendet. Sie können daher nicht mehr eingetauscht werden.
#. fr: Cet avoir atteste que vous avez remis à Rowena des mémoquartz allagois cosmogoniques ou poétiques. Il pouvait être échangé contre des équipements de grande qualité, mais n'est désormais plus valable.
#. column 0: Rowena's token (creation)
#. column 2: Rowena's tokens (creation)
#. column 9: Rowena's Token (Creation)
msgctxt "Item:19107:0:8"
msgid "A note of promise received from Rowena for the delivery of Allagan tomestones of creation or poetics. However, due to the House of Splendors changing its policies, it is now worth less than the paper on which it is scribed."
msgstr "Расписка, которую Ровена выдавала в обмен на аллагские камни мироздания или поэзии. Но Дом великолепия сменил правила, и теперь эта бумажка не стоит и клочка пергамента, на котором написана."

#. ja: ロウェナの手形:万物
#. de: Rowena-Marke „Schöpfung“
#. fr: Avoir de Rowena (cosmogonique/poétique)
#. column 0: Rowena's token (creation)
#. column 2: Rowena's tokens (creation)
#. column 8: A note of promise received from Rowena for the delivery of Allagan tomestones of creation or poetics. However, due to the House of Splendors changing its policies, it is now worth less than the paper on which it is scribed.
msgctxt "Item:19107:0:9"
msgid "Rowena's Token (Creation)"
msgstr "Вексель Ровены (мироздание)"

#. ja: 旧規格トームストーン
#. de: veraltet[a] Allagisch[a] Stein
#. fr: ancien modèle de mémoquartz
#. column 2: early model tomestones
#. column 8: Though considerably different in construction, Garlond Ironworks engineers insist this bulky contraption serves the same purpose as a traditional tomestone, and is merely of an earlier, less efficient design. This particular variety is not as highly sought as it once was, and may no longer be exchanged for other wares.
#. column 9: Early Model Tomestone
msgctxt "Item:19108:0:0"
msgid "early model tomestone"
msgstr "камень древнего образца"

#. de: veraltet[a] Allagisch[a] Steine
#. fr: anciens modèles de mémoquartz
#. column 0: early model tomestone
#. column 8: Though considerably different in construction, Garlond Ironworks engineers insist this bulky contraption serves the same purpose as a traditional tomestone, and is merely of an earlier, less efficient design. This particular variety is not as highly sought as it once was, and may no longer be exchanged for other wares.
#. column 9: Early Model Tomestone
msgctxt "Item:19108:0:2"
msgid "early model tomestones"
msgstr "камни древнего образца"

#. ja: 古代の情報が記されたアラグ文明の遺物。通常の物より規格が古い。<br>かつて熱心に収集する好事家がいたが流行は過ぎ去り、今や取引する者はいない
#. de: Ingenieure der Gar<shy>lond-Me<shy>tall<shy>wer<shy>ke bestehen darauf, dass diese unhandlichen Steine dem gleichen Zweck dienen wie herkömmliche Varianten. Laut ihnen handele es sich lediglich um ein früheres, weniger effizientes Design. Heute hat offenbar niemand mehr Interesse an diesen Objekten.
#. fr: Un modèle de mémoquartz allagois plus ancien encore que les autres et sur lequel sont gravées des in<shy>for<shy>ma<shy>tions de cette époque. Même si les col<shy>lec<shy>tion<shy>neurs se les arrachaient autrefois, ils ont depuis perdu en popularité, et plus personne ne les rachète.
#. column 0: early model tomestone
#. column 2: early model tomestones
#. column 9: Early Model Tomestone
msgctxt "Item:19108:0:8"
msgid "Though considerably different in construction, Garlond Ironworks engineers insist this bulky contraption serves the same purpose as a traditional tomestone, and is merely of an earlier, less efficient design. This particular variety is not as highly sought as it once was, and may no longer be exchanged for other wares."
msgstr "Хотя это громоздкое устройство устроено совсем иначе, инженеры «Топсейл» утверждают, что оно служит той же цели, что и обычный камень, просто сконструировано раньше и менее эффективно. Когда-то такие камни пользовались спросом, но теперь их уже не обменять на товары."

#. ja: 旧規格トームストーン
#. de: Veralteter Allagischer Stein
#. fr: Ancien modèle de mémoquartz
#. column 0: early model tomestone
#. column 2: early model tomestones
#. column 8: Though considerably different in construction, Garlond Ironworks engineers insist this bulky contraption serves the same purpose as a traditional tomestone, and is merely of an earlier, less efficient design. This particular variety is not as highly sought as it once was, and may no longer be exchanged for other wares.
msgctxt "Item:19108:0:9"
msgid "Early Model Tomestone"
msgstr "Томстоун древнего образца"

