#. ja: 豪神スサノオの刃
#. de: verspielt[a] Klinge
#. fr: lame de Susano
#. column 2: blades of revelry
#. column 8: The blade from a sword used by the Lord of the Revel himself. Despite being long removed from its hilt, the steel still shudders with unseen magicks.
#. column 9: Blade of Revelry
msgctxt "Item:19123:0:0"
msgid "blade of revelry"
msgstr "клинок веселья"

#. de: verspielt[a] Klingen
