#. ja: 美神ラクシュミの羽衣
#. de: gepflegt[a] Tuch
#. fr: étole de Lakshmi
#. column 2: blissful shrouds
#. column 8: A long sheet of translucent cloth taken from the robes worn by the Lady of the Bliss. In addition with being unnaturally lightweight, the shroud tingles the skin when touched.
#. column 9: Blissful Shroud
msgctxt "Item:19124:0:0"
msgid "blissful shroud"
msgstr "покров блаженства"

#. de: gepflegt[a] Tücher
