#. ja: 葛根
#. de: Kudzuwurzel
#. fr: tubercule de kudzu
#. column 2: kudzu roots
#. column 8: The root of the quick-growing kudzu vine is dug up and processed into kudzu powder which serves as a substitute for animal-based gelatins in Far Eastern desserts. It also is believed to exhibit healing properties, and can be found in most Hingan and Doman apothecaries.
#. column 9: Kudzu Root
msgctxt "Item:19853:0:0"
msgid "kudzu root"
msgstr "корень кудзу"

#. de: Kudzuwurzeln
#. fr: tubercules de kudzu
#. column 0: kudzu root
#. column 8: The root of the quick-growing kudzu vine is dug up and processed into kudzu powder which serves as a substitute for animal-based gelatins in Far Eastern desserts. It also is believed to exhibit healing properties, and can be found in most Hingan and Doman apothecaries.
#. column 9: Kudzu Root
msgctxt "Item:19853:0:2"
msgid "kudzu roots"
msgstr "корни кудзу"

#. ja: 東方で薬効を持つとされる葛の根
#. de: Die Wurzel der rasant wachsenden Kudzuranke wird ausgegraben und zu Kudzupulver verarbeitet, das als Ersatz für tierische Gelatine im Fernen Osten verwendet wird. Dem Pulver werden zudem gewisse Heilkräfte zugeschrieben, weshalb es bei vielen Arzneihändlern in Hingashi und Doma zu finden ist.
#. fr: Le tubercule d'une plante à qui on prête des vertus médicinales en Orient.
#. column 0: kudzu root
#. column 2: kudzu roots
#. column 9: Kudzu Root
msgctxt "Item:19853:0:8"
msgid "The root of the quick-growing kudzu vine is dug up and processed into kudzu powder which serves as a substitute for animal-based gelatins in Far Eastern desserts. It also is believed to exhibit healing properties, and can be found in most Hingan and Doman apothecaries."
msgstr "Корень быстрорастущей лианы кудзу перерабатывают в порошок, которым в дальневосточных десертах заменяют желатин животного происхождения. Считается, что он обладает целебными свойствами. Его можно найти в большинстве аптек Хингаси и Домы."

#. ja: 葛根
#. de: Kudzuwurzel
#. fr: Kudzu
#. column 0: kudzu root
#. column 2: kudzu roots
#. column 8: The root of the quick-growing kudzu vine is dug up and processed into kudzu powder which serves as a substitute for animal-based gelatins in Far Eastern desserts. It also is believed to exhibit healing properties, and can be found in most Hingan and Doman apothecaries.
msgctxt "Item:19853:0:9"
msgid "Kudzu Root"
msgstr "Корень кудзу"

#. ja: ドマ茄子
#. de: Doma-Aubergine
#. fr: bringèle domienne
#. column 2: Doman eggplants
#. column 8: While just as brilliantly purple, this Far Eastern cousin of the wizard eggplant is noticeably thinner, and thus requires less time to cook.
#. column 9: Doman Eggplant
msgctxt "Item:19854:0:0"
msgid "Doman eggplant"
msgstr "доманский баклажан"

#. de: Doma-Auberginen
#. fr: bringèles domiennes
#. column 0: Doman eggplant
#. column 8: While just as brilliantly purple, this Far Eastern cousin of the wizard eggplant is noticeably thinner, and thus requires less time to cook.
#. column 9: Doman Eggplant
msgctxt "Item:19854:0:2"
msgid "Doman eggplants"
msgstr "Домановские баклажаны"

#. ja: オサード小大陸原産の紫色の果菜
#. de: Eine Auberginenart aus dem Fernen Osten. Farblich kaum von der Gattung in Aldenard zu unterscheiden, allerdings ist sie deutlich dünner und lässt sich dadurch schneller kochen.
#. fr: Cette aubergine brillante, d'une teinte violette, pousse sur le continent d'Othard.
#. column 0: Doman eggplant
#. column 2: Doman eggplants
#. column 9: Doman Eggplant
msgctxt "Item:19854:0:8"
msgid "While just as brilliantly purple, this Far Eastern cousin of the wizard eggplant is noticeably thinner, and thus requires less time to cook."
msgstr "Этот дальневосточный родственник баклажана-волшебника такой же ярко-фиолетовый, но заметно тоньше, а значит, готовится быстрее."

#. ja: ドマ茄子
#. de: Doma-Aubergine
#. fr: Bringèle domienne
#. column 0: Doman eggplant
#. column 2: Doman eggplants
#. column 8: While just as brilliantly purple, this Far Eastern cousin of the wizard eggplant is noticeably thinner, and thus requires less time to cook.
msgctxt "Item:19854:0:9"
msgid "Doman Eggplant"
msgstr "Доманский баклажан"

#. ja: 大根
#. de: Daikon-Rettich
#. fr: grand radis oriental
#. column 2: daikon radishes
#. column 8: The spicy daikon radishes of Othard are known to grow as long and thick as a grown Hyur's forearm.
#. column 9: Daikon Radish
msgctxt "Item:19855:0:0"
msgid "daikon radish"
msgstr "редька дайкон"

#. de: Daikon-Rettiche
#. fr: grands radis orientaux
#. column 0: daikon radish
#. column 8: The spicy daikon radishes of Othard are known to grow as long and thick as a grown Hyur's forearm.
#. column 9: Daikon Radish
msgctxt "Item:19855:0:2"
msgid "daikon radishes"
msgstr "редьки дайкон"

#. ja: オサード小大陸原産の大型の根菜
#. de: Die würzigen Daikon-Rettiche aus Othard werden so groß und dick wie der Unterarm eines Hyuran.
#. fr: Ce légume-racine riche en minéraux est originaire du continent d'Othard.
#. column 0: daikon radish
#. column 2: daikon radishes
#. column 9: Daikon Radish
msgctxt "Item:19855:0:8"
msgid "The spicy daikon radishes of Othard are known to grow as long and thick as a grown Hyur's forearm."
msgstr "Острая редька дайкон из Отхарда вырастает длиной и толщиной с предплечье взрослого хьюра."

