msgstr "Сахарная свёкла"

#. ja: ジャムメルジンジャー
#. de: Stück[p] Jhammel-Ingwer
#. fr: rhizome de gingembre jhammel
#. column 2: pieces of jhammel ginger
#. column 8: Jhammel ginger's bulbous, aromatic roots can be sliced fresh and added to stews and seafood dishes to remove gaminess, ground and steeped in hot water to cure head colds, or dried and ground into a powder to use as a spice for breads and cookies.
#. column 9: Jhammel Ginger
msgctxt "Item:19857:0:0"
msgid "piece of jhammel ginger"
msgstr "кусок имбиря джаммель"

#. de: Stücke[p] Jhammel-Ingwer
#. fr: rhizomes de gingembre jhammel
#. column 0: piece of jhammel ginger
#. column 8: Jhammel ginger's bulbous, aromatic roots can be sliced fresh and added to stews and seafood dishes to remove gaminess, ground and steeped in hot water to cure head colds, or dried and ground into a powder to use as a spice for breads and cookies.
#. column 9: Jhammel Ginger
msgctxt "Item:19857:0:2"
msgid "pieces of jhammel ginger"
msgstr "куски имбиря джаммель"

#. ja: 根茎から成るスパイス。辛味が少ない稀少な品種
#. de: Die knolligen, aromatischen Wurzeln des Jhammel-Ingwers eignen sich als Zutat oder Gewürz für allerlei leckere Gerichte. Zermahlen und mit Wasser aufgekocht, werden sie auch gerne bei Erkältungen genutzt.
#. fr: Ce tubercule épicé fait partie des rares espèces de gingembre au goût modéré.
#. column 0: piece of jhammel ginger
#. column 2: pieces of jhammel ginger
#. column 9: Jhammel Ginger
msgctxt "Item:19857:0:8"
msgid "Jhammel ginger's bulbous, aromatic roots can be sliced fresh and added to stews and seafood dishes to remove gaminess, ground and steeped in hot water to cure head colds, or dried and ground into a powder to use as a spice for breads and cookies."
msgstr "У имбиря джаммель мясистые душистые корни. Свежими ломтиками их добавляют в рагу и блюда из морепродуктов, чтобы убрать привкус дичи; измельчённые заваривают в горячей воде от простуды, а высушенные и перемолотые используют как пряность для хлеба и печенья."

#. ja: ジャムメルジンジャー
#. de: Jhammel-Ingwer
#. fr: Gingembre jhammel
#. column 0: piece of jhammel ginger
#. column 2: pieces of jhammel ginger
#. column 8: Jhammel ginger's bulbous, aromatic roots can be sliced fresh and added to stews and seafood dishes to remove gaminess, ground and steeped in hot water to cure head colds, or dried and ground into a powder to use as a spice for breads and cookies.
msgctxt "Item:19857:0:9"
msgid "Jhammel Ginger"
msgstr "Имбирь джаммель"

#. ja: ギラバニアカロット
#. de: abanisch[a] Karotte
#. fr: carotte gyrabanienne
#. column 2: Gyr Abanian carrots
#. column 8: Gyr Abanian carrots are not only longer, but a far deeper orange─nay, crimson─than those grown in central and western Eorzea.
#. column 9: Gyr Abanian Carrot
msgctxt "Item:19858:0:0"
msgid "Gyr Abanian carrot"
msgstr "гир-абанийская морковь"

#. de: abanisch[a] Karotten
