#. column 8: Gyr Abanian carrots are not only longer, but a far deeper orange─nay, crimson─than those grown in central and western Eorzea.
msgctxt "Item:19858:0:9"
msgid "Gyr Abanian Carrot"
msgstr "Гир-абанийская морковь"

