#. ja: タケノコ
#. de: Bambussprosse
#. fr: pousse de bambou
#. column 2: bamboo shoots
#. column 8: If removed from the ground when less than a fulm in length, bamboo shoots can be peeled and the fleshy interior eaten. A popular ingredient in Far Eastern stews and stir-fries.
