#. ja: マウンテンポポト
#. de: Bergtoffel
#. fr: popoto des montagnes
#. column 2: mountain popotoes
#. column 8: Crisp mountain popotoes contain high quantities of starch that create a viscous paste when the tubers are ground. This paste can be eaten raw, fried into cakes, or added to stews for thickening.
#. column 9: Mountain Popoto
msgctxt "Item:19861:0:0"
msgid "mountain popoto"
msgstr "горный картофель-попото"

#. de: Bergtoffeln
#. fr: popotos des montagnes
#. column 0: mountain popoto
#. column 8: Crisp mountain popotoes contain high quantities of starch that create a viscous paste when the tubers are ground. This paste can be eaten raw, fried into cakes, or added to stews for thickening.
#. column 9: Mountain Popoto
msgctxt "Item:19861:0:2"
msgid "mountain popotoes"
msgstr "горные картофели-попото"

#. ja: ギラバニア原産の粘り気のある根菜
#. de: Frische Bergtoffeln enthalten einen hohen Anteil an Stärke, die beim Zermahlen der Knollengewächse zu einer zähen Paste wird. Damit lassen sich unter anderem Eintöpfe verdicken.
#. fr: Cet igname originaire de Gyr Abania a une chair savoureuse connue pour sa viscosité.
#. column 0: mountain popoto
#. column 2: mountain popotoes
#. column 9: Mountain Popoto
msgctxt "Item:19861:0:8"
msgid "Crisp mountain popotoes contain high quantities of starch that create a viscous paste when the tubers are ground. This paste can be eaten raw, fried into cakes, or added to stews for thickening."
msgstr "Хрустящий горный попото богат крахмалом. Если размолоть клубни, получится вязкая паста: её едят сырой, жарят в виде лепёшек или добавляют в рагу для густоты."

#. ja: マウンテンポポト
