#. fr: Popoto des montagnes
#. column 0: mountain popoto
#. column 2: mountain popotoes
#. column 8: Crisp mountain popotoes contain high quantities of starch that create a viscous paste when the tubers are ground. This paste can be eaten raw, fried into cakes, or added to stews for thickening.
msgctxt "Item:19861:0:9"
